{"title":"List of server hosting providers","sourceTitle":"List of server hosting providers/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/List_of_server_hosting_providers\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"List of server hosting providers (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/List_of_server_hosting_providers/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Cписок хостингов для серверов (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li></ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"A_hospedagem_oficial_do_servidor_Vintage_Story\">A hospedagem oficial do servidor Vintage Story</span></h2>\n<p>A hospedagem está disponível pelos criadores do jogo através do painel do servidor integrado,<br /> \n<b>MAS NÃO PERMITE ADICIONAR MODS </b> ainda, <br />\ne os servidores estão localizados apenas na Europa Central.<br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/store/product/7-simple-server-hosting-8-slots/\">a loja oficial</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Provedores_n.C3.A3o_oficiais_de_hospedagem_de_servidores_Vintage_Story\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Provedores_não_oficiais_de_hospedagem_de_servidores_Vintage_Story\">Provedores não oficiais de hospedagem de servidores Vintage Story</span></h2>\n<p>Serviços de hospedagem de terceiros sem ordem específica (e não verificados):\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://servidores.ilharestrita.com/products/vintage-story\">Ilha Restrita</a> (um fornecedor oficial do jogo, mas a hospedagem do servidor é separada)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://nolimithost.cc/games/vintagestory\">Nolimit Host</a> (discount code <code>VINTAGESTORY</code> 15% off for first month)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.gtxgaming.co.uk/\">GTX.gaming.uk</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.g-portal.com/\">Gportal</a> (if you install mods, you probably should disable auto-updating the game)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://hosthavoc.com/game-servers/vintage-story\">Host Havoc</a> (discount code <code>VINTAGE_STORY_25</code> for 25% off for life)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/vintage-story-server-hosting\">Bisecthosting</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pingperfect.com/gameservers/vintage-story-game-server-hosting-rental.php\">Pingperfect</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ghostcap.com/hosting/vintage-story\">GhostCap Hosting</a> (discount code <code>GHOST50</code> for 50% off your first month)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://winternode.com/games/vintage-story?utm_source=vswiki\">WinterNode</a> (discount code <code>WNSTORY</code> for 30% off)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.kinetichosting.net/game-servers/vintage-story\">KineticHosting.net</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.akliz.net/games/vintage-story\">Akliz</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://shockbyte.com/games/vintage-story-server-hosting\">Shockbyte</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://nodecraft.com/games/vintage-story-server-hosting\">Nodecraft</a> (código de desconto $ 1 para 30% de desconto no primeiro mês, suporte para instalação do ModDB com 1 clique)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://vexiumhosting.com\">Vexium Hosting</a> (discount codes <code>VSLIFE</code> for 20% off lifetime, <code>VS30OFF</code> for 30% off first month)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bandithost.com/html/vintage.html\">Bandithost</a> (discount code <code>VS75</code> for 75% off your first month)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.creeperhost.net/game/vintage-story/wiki\">CreeperHost</a> (choice of <code>20%</code> off for life or <code>50%</code> off first month, discount selected on landing, built-in ModDB install/update support, hourly backups)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://citadelservers.com/game-servers/vintage-story-game-hosting\">CitadelHosting</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.4netplayers.com/en-us/gameserver-hosting/vintage-story/?referer=https%3A%2F%2Fwiki.vintagestory.at%2FList_of_server_hosting_providers\">4netplayers</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lagless.gg/pricing?game=vintage-story\">lagless.gg</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://suhosting.net/\">Something Unique Hosting</a> (Offering $1/1GB Budget Plans or Ryzen 9 Plans, 1-Click ModDB Installs, Coupon <code>vswiki</code> for 15% off lifetime)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://godlike.host/gaf_vs\">Godlike.host</a> (discount code <code>VS50</code> for 50% off first purchase)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bedrockhost.pl/oferta/vintage-story\">Bedrock Host</a> (eastern Europe)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.gamehostbros.com/vintage-story-server-hosting\">Game Host Bros</a> (discount code <code>ILOVEVINTAGESTORY50</code> for 50% off first month; has several <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://guides.gamehostbros.com/games/vintage-story/\">guides</a> specific to managing Vintage Story)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cliente.beanshosting.net/store/vintage-story-hosting\">BeansHosting.net</a> (the provider is Spanish language, but also provides support in other languages)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tekknodes.com/game_servers\">TekkNodes</a> (discount code <code>VintageStory20</code> for 20% off)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wabbanode.com/games/vintage-story-server-hosting\">Wabbanode</a> (discount code <code>WELCOME10</code> for 10% off)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://supercraft.host/vintage-story-server-hosting/\">Supercraft</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://indifferentbroccoli.com/vintage-story-server-hosting\">Indifferent Broccoli</a> (unlimited ram. pay per slot.)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://aleforge.net/vintage-story/\">AleForge</a> (discount code <code>VintageStoryWiki</code> for 30% off. Unlimited slots &amp; CPU)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Muro_da_Vergonha\">Muro da Vergonha</span></h2>\n<p>Apenas não faça isso. Você foi avisado.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Oracle Cloud free tier (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/302152934249070593/406473219239968768/1367141527607967904\">explicação</a> por que não)</li>\n<li>Zap-hosting.com (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/302152934249070593/406473219239968768/1472493014483206266\">incompetente</a> e <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/302152934249070593/406473219239968768/1472492679932936385\">sem recurso</a>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached 